sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant App
    participant Int as TracingInterceptor (Ch 1)
    participant BE as Backend services
    participant Obs as Observability (analytics/crash, Ch 82/83)

    User->>App: start checkout
    App->>App: correlationId + start trace (opaque, Ch 28)
    App->>Obs: set correlationId (super-property/custom key)
    App->>Int: placeOrder request
    Int->>BE: inject traceparent + X-Correlation-Id + new span
    BE->>BE: continue trace across services + log correlationId
    BE-->>App: response (same trace recorded)
    Note over App,BE: one correlationId joins client analytics/crash + backend traces
